                {
                    "id": "engineering",
                    "topic": "engineering",
                    "basis": "interpretation",
                    "text": "FS intent旁路捕获不接管策略、回退沿请求会话权限、状态临时文件原子发布值得借鉴。大型入口承担多种状态转换，迁移/多会话/外部编辑的组合验证是维护成本；不能把UI undo当持久恢复。 源码依据：[src/index.ts](https://github.com/9087/dsh-diff-approval/blob/393bdc4c9b6ee007027c9e4da4d9732d60c9e168/src/index.ts)、[src/pending.ts](https://github.com/9087/dsh-diff-approval/blob/393bdc4c9b6ee007027c9e4da4d9732d60c9e168/src/pending.ts)、[src/persist.ts](https://github.com/9087/dsh-diff-approval/blob/393bdc4c9b6ee007027c9e4da4d9732d60c9e168/src/persist.ts)、[src/atomic-write.ts](https://github.com/9087/dsh-diff-approval/blob/393bdc4c9b6ee007027c9e4da4d9732d60c9e168/src/atomic-write.ts)。",
